      title: "Job Advert: Helper at the Pet Shop",
      passage: "HAPPY PAWS PET SHOP\n12 High Street, Oxford\n\nWe need a WEEKEND HELPER!\n\nDo you love animals? Are you friendly and hard-working? Then this job is for you!\n\nAbout the job:\nYou work on Saturdays and Sundays, from 9:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. You help our customers, give food and water to the animals, and clean the cages. You also put new products on the shelves. We have dogs, cats, rabbits, birds and fish in the shop.\n\nAbout you:\n- You are 16 years old or older.\n- You love animals and you are not afraid of them.\n- You are friendly and you like talking to people.\n- You can work every weekend.\n- You don't need experience — we teach you everything!\n\nPay:\n£9 an hour. You also get a 20% discount on everything in the shop.\n\nHow to apply:\nCome to the shop and talk to the manager, Mrs Jones, from Monday to Friday between 2:00 and 5:00 p.m. Please bring a short letter about you. Or send an email to jobs@happypaws.com.\n\nWe can't wait to meet you!",
